@startuml
title Record Expense and Refresh Balances
autonumber

actor Member
participant "SplitSmart dashboard" as UI
participant "Expenses API route" as API
participant "Prisma Client" as Prisma
database "SQLite" as DB

Member -> UI : Enter description, amount, payer, participants
UI -> API : POST /api/groups/{groupId}/expenses
API -> API : Validate amount, description, IDs, and participants

alt Invalid input or group membership
  API --> UI : 400 error with explanation
  UI --> Member : Display error
else Valid expense
  API -> Prisma : Find payer and participants in group
  Prisma -> DB : Query SplitSmartMember
  DB --> Prisma : Matching members
  Prisma --> API : Member IDs
  API -> API : Sort participant IDs
  API -> API : Divide cents evenly; assign remainder in ID order
  API -> Prisma : Create expense and participant shares
  Prisma -> DB : Insert SplitSmartExpense + SplitSmartShare rows
  DB --> Prisma : Stored expense and shares
  Prisma --> API : Created record
  API --> UI : 201 expense with shares
  UI -> API : GET /api/groups/{groupId}
  API -> Prisma : Load members, expenses, payers, and shares
  Prisma -> DB : Query SplitSmart tables
  DB --> Prisma : Group ledger
  Prisma --> API : Group detail
  API --> UI : 200 group detail
  UI -> UI : For each member, add paid cents and subtract share cents
  UI --> Member : Show history and balances
end

note over API
  For n participants:
  base share = floor(amountCents / n)
  remainder = amountCents mod n
  The first remainder participants by ID receive one extra cent.
end note

note over UI
  Each expense's shares equal its total, so member balances sum to zero.
end note
@enduml